The '''77th Grand Battalion''' was an [[Iron Warriors]] [[Grand Battalion]] known to have been active during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
The 77th Grand Battalion remained loyal to the [[Imperium]] during the [[Horus Heresy]]. By 006.31M the 77th Grand Battalion appeared on [[Paramar V]] during the time of the Horus Heresy after 4 gruelling decades of war on the [[Therikon Wastes]]. Ignorant of the ensuing conflict, the Grand Battalion was attacked by [[Alpha Legion]] forces, forcing the Iron Warriors to take part in the battle for Paramar V. By the time of the Horus Heresy, the 77th Grand Battalion consisted of 2,800 Legionaries.{{Fn|1a}} 

