Aaa.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''Aaa''' was a [[human]] male [[Pit Slave|pit fighter]] captured from [[Borea]].  His name translated into [[Gothic]] as "Sword-Cuts-Meat-For-Woman-Prizes."{{Fn|1}}

Born and raised on a true Feral World, Aaa was a brutal man; he was tanned, tall, strong, and utterly bestial. He possessed teeth filed into points and fingertips that had been bound into claws. While being transported from Borea to [[Quenthus VIII]], he ripped a fellow prisoner's arm from its socket, necessitating being bound in shackles at all times. Even after arrival, he scalped a guard using his teeth.{{Fn|1}}

Aaa was later purchased by [[Pontius Glaw]] in 019.[[M41]], while Glaw was on Quenthus buying fighters for his "pit-games."  It was only after Aaa gave Glaw his golden torc necklace that Glaw purchased him.  The torc, however, was tainted by [[Chaos]]; when Glaw foolishly put it on, the object focused the stuff of darkness into Glaw's mind.  Glaw fondly remembered that time as when he "crossed the line" and decided to devote his life and soul to Chaos.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
