{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
[[Image:Botswain.gif|thumbnail|right|Bosun Aberic Brawden{{Fn|2}}]]
'''Aberic Brawden''' is an [[Imperial Navy]] [[Bosun]], serving aboard the ''[[Scalermo's Hammer]]''.{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
He was born on the [[Feral World]] [[Heoren]] and that is where Brawden began his [[Imperial Navy]] career, after being [[press-gang]]ed into service. Now a [[Bosun]] aboard the ''[[Scalermo's Hammer]]'', Brawden once served as the bodyguard{{Fn|1a}} for the warship's [[Navigator]], [[Teodor Minodya]]. However, this changed when Teodor used his expert guidance to bring the ''Hammer'' back to [[Cadia]], after it was attacked by [[Chaos]] raiders. The Navigator was rewarded for his actions by being given a [[Free Charter]], which allowed Teodor to lease his services to whomever he chose to.{{Fn|1b}} 

