The '''Abomination of Badzone 12''' is a giant [[Chaos Spawn]] that dwells in the depths of [[Hive Primus]] on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]].{{Fn|1}} 

Rumours in the [[Underhive]] claim that it was originally the [[Cult of the Sump Mother]], whose profane god turned them all into the Abomination. Numerous faces are now said to scream out from its flesh, as the Chaos Spawn feeds upon itself, [[Mutants]] and [[rat]]s as it travels through the Hive's depths. Whether or not this is true, none in the Underhive can deny the existence of the Abomination, as it is known to hunt there during [[Hive Primus]]' dark cycles. Entire homesteads, caravans and even settlements have been discovered to have been attacked and stripped of meat by the Chaos Spawn. Some [[Chaos Cult]]s even attempt to lure the Abomination out with promises of food, in order to loose it against their foes. However, the Cults that do so might just as easily find themselves to be the Chaos Spawn's prey instead.{{Fn|1}}

