Ackenvol.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Ackenvol''' was a [[Quartermaster General]] of the [[Planetary Defence Forces]] of [[Quintus]].{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
Ackenvol was formerly a member of the [[Astra Militarum]]. He rose his way up through the ranks over a long career, eventually becoming an officer in the [[Officio Munitorum]]. He was eventually assigned to Quintus, overseeing the build-up of arms and war materiel there.{{Fn|1b}}

When Quintus was subjugated by an [[Alpha Legion]] warband led by the [[Daemon Prince]] [[Kernax Voldorius]], Ackenvol was amongst those in the Quintus PDF to surrender to the [[Chaos Space Marine|Traitor Marines]] and abandon the [[Imperium]] in favour of serving Voldorius.{{Fn|1a}}

Later, the 3rd Companies of the [[White Scars]] and [[Raven Guard]] arrived to [[Hunt for Voldorius|liberate Quintus]]. In the aftermath of the [[Space Marines]]' successful initial assault on [[Mankarra]], Voldorius demanded to know who was responsible. [[Lord Colonel]] [[Morkis]] named Ackenvol to blame, before killing all of the officers present with his [[laspistol]].{{Fn|1b}}

