Adelmo.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''Adelmo''' was a [[Veteran Squad (Space Marines)|Veteran Space Marine]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
At one point Adelmo was chosen to undertake a tour of service with the [[Deathwatch]].  He later returned to his Chapter following the completion of this duty.{{Fn|1}}

Some time after this, he was part of a [[Sternguard Veteran]] squadron led by [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Tatianus]].  The squad was assigned to support a [[3rd Company (Ultramarines)|Third Company]] task force led by [[Chaplain]] [[Ortan Cassius|Cassius]] in the liberation of the [[Imperial]] city of [[Skemarchus]], which had been invaded by [[ork]]s.{{Fn|1}}

At some point during the battle to take Skemarchus's port facilities, the orks deployed a [[Gargant]] to attack the Imperials.  Adelmo was killed in one of the Gargant's cannon barrages.  [[Vael Donatus|Donatus]], Adelmo's squadmate, later destroyed the Gargant by setting off a chain reaction that destroyed the manufactorium it was in and caused the war machine to plunge into the lava beneath the city.  Unfortunately, many of the dead Ultramarines' bodies fell into the lava as well, with Adelmo's believed to be among them.{{Fn|1}}

