'''Adivarius''' was a [[Raven Guard]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], who led his [[Chapter]]'s strike force that was sent to destroy an [[Ork]] [[Waaagh!]] in [[M41]].{{Fn|1}} 

[[Astra Militarum]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiments]] were also taking part in the battle and wrongly claimed the victory was theirs once the [[Orks]] were defeated. The regiments had been unaware, however, that Adivarius had secretly deployed a [[Raven Guard]] [[Space Marine Company|Company]] behind the Orks' battle-lines. Though the regiments did not see the Raven Guard fighting the Orks, this Company was ultimately responsible for the [[Waaagh!]]'s downfall. The Raven Guard did not reveal this, however, until after [[Lord Commissar]] [[Oleg van Mises]] sent a light-hearted communique to Adivarius, celebrating that his [[Guardsmen]] had won without the strike force's aid. Once the Raven Guard contacted the Militarum with the truth of their part in the battle, though, Mises and his forces were stripped of the medals they had been given. The Lord Commissar was then executed for besmirching the honour of the Raven Guard.{{Fn|1}}

