Adrian Iden.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Adrian Iden''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] in the [[8th Cadian]] [[Regiment]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
{{Spoiler|source=Space Marine II}}
[[File:Adrian Iden.JPG|thumb|250px|Captain Adrian Iden {{fn|2}}]]
They were among the [[Imperial]] forces that aided in the defense of the [[Tyranid]] invaded [[Recidious System]]. During the campaign to save the [[System]], Iden was among the [[8th Cadian]] that defended [[Kadaku]] from the [[Xenos]]. When the decision was later made to abandon the world, the [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] aided in the evacuation effort. He was under the command of [[Major]] [[Sarkaana]], who was charged with protecting Kadaku's [[Orbital Defence Cannon]]s. These massive weapons were needed to keep the Tyranids' [[Bio-Ship]]'s at bay, so that the Imperium could evacuate Kadaku. However, the Tyranids swarmed the [[Regiment]] and forced the 8th Cadian to retreat before the evacuation was complete. While her Guardsmen regrouped in a new location, Iden was not amongst them and Sarkaana thought he had been killed. 

In truth, Iden had become separated from the Regiment as it retreated and he took command of a number of Guardsmen who had suffered the same fate. As they defended themselves, the Captain repeatedly tried to contact [[Sarkaana]] and ask when they would launch their next attack against the [[Xenos]]. However with his long-range [[vox]] damaged, Iden had been unable to reach the [[Major]], until his group encountered the [[Ultramarines]]' [[Combat Squad Damocles]]. They were members of the [[Chapter]]'s [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]], which had also been aiding in defending the [[Recidious System]], and were led by their commander, [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] [[Demetrian Titus]]. They had been sent by their [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], [[Sevastus Acheran]], to reclaim the [[Orbital Defence Cannon]]s and had just left the area that the [[8th Cadian]] had regrouped in. The Lieutenant then contacted Sarkaana, who was glad to find out that the Captain still lived. Afterwards, though, she ordered him to aid Titus in recapturing the facility that housed [[Kadaku]]'s Orbital Cannons. Once they did so, the Major transported her forces there with [[Valkyrie]]s and defended the area, while Titus successfully recharged the Cannons. With the massive weapons firing once more, the evacuation was able to continue. It is not known, though, if Iden survived the battle.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Space Marine II]] - ''Mission 1, Skyfire''
*{{Endn|2}}: [[Space Marine II]] - Datavault Research Center: Forces of the Imperium
