==History==
He was among the [[Space Wolves]] that defended their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]], [[Fenris]], from the [[Daemon Primarch]] [[Magnus]] and the [[Thousand Sons]], during the [[Siege of the Fenris System]]. As the invasion raged on their Homeworld, [[Njal Stormcaller]] led Aedir and a number of other [[Rune Priests]] to attack Magnus on the '''Firepeaks''', with their [[psychic]] might. However such was his own psychic power, that Magnus was able to mask his [[Warp]] presence from their attacks, despite the Rune Priests being able to clearly see the Daemon Prince.{{Fn|1}} Though the Thousand Sons were later defeated, it is not known if Aedir survived the invasion.{{Fn|2}}

