Aez'ashya.wikitext:
{{DarkEldarPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Dark Eldar]] [[Wych]] [[Succubus]] and later [[Archon]].{{Fn|1a}}

Serving as an agent of the [[Archon]] [[Xelian]] of the [[Kabal of the Blades of Desire]], after her Archon's apparent death {{PAGENAME}} was able to assuming control of the Kabal.{{Fn|1a}} She was able to quickly defeat any challengers before her in duels, but was caught in the chaos of [[Commorragh]]'s [[Dysjunction]] and thought dead.{{Fn|1b}} However {{PAGENAME}} survived, having successfully navigated the lower realms of Commorragh and rallied her Kabal. She then allied with [[Asdrubael Vect]] and led her forces to defend Commorragh from [[Daemon]]s alongside [[Yllithian]] of the [[Kabal of the White Flames]].{{Fn|1c}}

After the Dark Eldar were victorious, {{PAGENAME}} immediately turned on Yllithian but was thrawted by his [[Incubus]] bodyguards.{{Fn|1d}} However shortly after Xelian, now possessed by a [[Daemon]], returned to Commorragh and easily slew {{PAGENAME}}.{{Fn|2}}

