Verrox is known for his belligerent tactics, thinly-disguised bloodlust, and chainblade teeth. He was a legend within the Chapter even before becoming an Iron Father, earning a reputation fighting the [[Tau]] [[Second Sphere of Expansion]] in the [[Western Veil]] and commanding the then-young [[Kardan Stronos]]. It is perhaps ironic, as in his 700 years of service the Western Veil Campaign was one of the greatest Chapter defeats. However, his cold logic and willingness to abandon lost cause impressed the [[Iron Council]].{{Fn|4}}

