Agentha.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}{{clear}}

'''Agentha''' is a [[Orders Dialogous|Sister Dialogous]] of the [[Adepta Sororitas]], member of the [[Order of the Fractured Cipher]]. Her specialty is languages, but she is also trained for combat, like all Sisters.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Agentha was born an orphan on the planet [[Honoria (Planet)|Honoria]] during an [[Ork]] [[Battle for Honoria|invasion]], the daughter of [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] [[Ladbon Antilov]] of the [[Vostroyan Firstborn]] and [[Marita]], daughter of Honoria's [[Planetary Governor]].  Both Ladbon and Marita were killed by the Orks during the invasion, but Agentha was delivered just after her mother's death by [[Apothecary]] [[Rephial]], a [[Space Marine]] of the [[Dark Angels]] [[Chapter]].  The [[Vostroya]]n [[Guardsman|guardsmen]] Marita was with when she died honoured her wish to name the child after Marita's mother, Agentha.{{Fn|2}}

Agentha had the unusual honour of having two Space Marines present at her birth, a result of the second Marine, [[Librarian]] [[Ezekiel]] foreseeing Marita's death with his newly-returned [[divination]] abilities and attempting to save the [[Imperial Guard]] unit she was with.  Ezekiel also foresaw many details of Agentha's life.{{Fn|2}}

Agentha was raised at a [[Schola Progenium]] facility, always at the top of her class.  After her time at the schola, she was accepted into a convent of the [[Adepta Sororitas]].{{Fn|2}}

