Aglepus.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Aglepus''' is an [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]], who led a strike force from the [[Chapter]] in the [[Charadon Campaign]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
During the conflict, the [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]]'s forces nearly came to blows with an [[Order of the Bloody Rose]] strike force. The [[Adepta Sororitas]] had been dispatched from the [[Indomitus Crusade]]'s [[Battle Group Tarsus]], to cleanse everyone on the invaded [[Imperial]] world [[Laboritum]]. However despite it being [[Daemon|Demonically]] corrupted by the [[Night Lords]] and [[Hollow Ghouls]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]], there were still [[Astra Militarum]] and [[Skitarii]] forces resisting the invaders. It was for the lives of these Imperial forces, that Aglepus intervened in order to stop the Bloody Rose from killing them. However the Sororitas stated they were following standing orders given to them, to destroy wide-spread Daemonic corrupted worlds, by the [[High Lord of Terra|High Lord]] [[Morvenn Vahl]]. After the Bloody Rose presented Aglepus with Vahl's seal, the Lieutenant and the Ultramarines were convinced to aid the Sororitas in cleansing Laboritum.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
