'''Ah-hotep''' is a [[Necron]] [[Plas­mancer]] who served the [[Techno­mandrites]] and because of this, she came to the attention of the [[Silent King]]. As his forces began constructing the [[Pariah Nexus]], Ah-hotep was ordered by the Silent King to aid [[Necron Overlord|Overlord]] [[Simut]] in his task of increasing the size of the Nexus.{{Fn|1}}

