Ahluic Xotzin.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Ahluic Xotzin''' is the current [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Obsidian Jaguars]].{{Fn|1}}

After learning that their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]], [[Ceibhal]], had fallen to an [[Ork]] invasion, Xotzin vowed revenge and rallied the surviving Obsidian Jaguars to his side. When 90 to 95 percent were able to do so, Xotzin prepared them to retake their Homeworld; however, their preparations were interrupted when they received pleas for help from the [[Pankallis Sub-sector]]. Though he was eager to reclaim Ceibhal, Xotzin led the Chapter to aid the besieged Sub-sector, as the Jaguars' duties to the [[Imperium]] were more important. That, and the wrathful Chapter would be able to sooner release their vengeance against the Orks, by attacking the Greenskins infesting Pankallis.{{Fn|1}}

