Ahrak (Sorcerer).wikitext:
{{TzeentchPortal}}{{ThousandSonsPortal}}
'''Ahrak the Time Weaver'''{{Fn|1a}} is a [[Thousand Sons]] [[Temporal Sorcerer|Temporal]] [[Infernal Master]]{{Fn|1b}}, who commands the [[Coven Temporus]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
He seeks artefacts of ancient provenance and uses esoteric means to travel the stars in search of them, by riding the temporal flow of the universe. This allows Ahrak to skip back and forth through the ages of reality, as he carries out his quest, though, it is not known if he ultimately seeks to increase the [[Thousand Sons]]' power by doing so or only his own. The [[Coven Temporus]]  aid Ahrak in this task and its [[Scarab Occult Terminator]]s act as his bodyguards{{Fn|1a}}. The [[Infernal Master]] also makes use of his bound [[Tutelary]] familiars to hear the whispers of the future, master the currents of the [[empyrean]] and summons swarms of them to engulf his foes.{{Fn|1b}}

