Aias Telemonian.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Aias Telemonian''' is an [[Epistolary]] in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He is a veteran of the [[Battle for the Cadian Gate]], the [[Siege of Anachronox]], the [[Damocles Gulf Crusade]] and the  [[Third War for Armageddon]].{{Fn|1}} When the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]] began,{{Fn|2}} Telemonian took part{{Fn|1}} in its [[Gathrog Campaign]] and fought against the [[Green Kroosade]]'s [[Orks]]{{Fn|3}} that were invading the [[Scarus Sector]]. The [[Epistolary]] was later given command of the [[Space Marine]] forces that were fighting in regions overrun by the [[Warboss]] [[Zoom]].{{Fn|1}} In a report to his [[Chapter Master]], [[Marneus Calgar]], Telemonian said that Zoom was a cunning and loathsome plague on the Scarus Sector, but was also a worthy foe. However the Epistolary swore the Warboss would die at the hands of the [[Ultramarines]]. This was later proven true, when Zoom was killed during one of the Campaign's battles.{{Fn|4}} 
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
