Aidan Perdron.wikitext:
{{GreyKnightsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Grey Knights Grand Master|Grand Master]] of the [[Grey Knights]], commanding the [[8th Brotherhood (Grey Knights)|8th Brotherhood]] as '''Knight Commander of the Recruits'''.{{Fn|1}}

This rank is similar to [[Master of Recruits]] title held by the [[10th Company]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of regular [[chapter]]s, however, there is a notable difference. Where in a standard chapter, the 10th Company is made from [[Space Marine Scout|Scouts]] and [[neophyte]]s, the 8th Brotherhood is composed entirely of full battle brothers, as the Grey Knights train every [[aspirant]] fully before permitting them to function in the field lest they be corrupted during their training. Perdron's Brotherhood is for those Grey Knights who are newly promoted to full Battle-Brother who then move on to other Brotherhoods as suits their preferences, although many members remain to help guide the new influx of Knights.{{Fn|1}}

