Ajak Khan.wikitext:
{{WhiteScarsPortal}}
'''Ajak Khan''' was the [[Space Marine Captain|Khan]] of the [[White Scars]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[Brotherhood of the Amber Eagle]], during the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
In the later years of the [[Siege of Terra|Siege]], Ajak's [[Brotherhood of the Amber Eagle|Brotherhood]] defended the [[Imperial Palace]]'s inner walls, from [[Horus]]' [[Chaos]] forces. Like all who did so, the Amber Eagle had suffered heavy losses, but continued to repel the invaders. One attempt saw Ajak clash with [[World Eaters]] - a [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] Ajak pitied as much as he hated. With his Brotherhood at his side, the Khan engaged in the close combat he loved so much, against the World Eaters and the lesser rabble that followed them. However despite his skills, Ajak was killed, though, the White Scars considered it to have been a good death. While his body was recovered, his Brotherhood had been forced to retreat from the Palace's inner walls by the World Eaters. The Amber Eagle had been so ravaged, however, that it was disbanded by their Legion and its members sent to other Brotherhoods. Ajak's [[Power Sword]], which was originally wielded by [[Morbun Xa]], was later given to [[Jangsai Khan]] by the [[Stormseer]] [[Naranbaatar]].{{Fn|1}}

