Ajex Gorgoth.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Ajex Gorgoth, the Lord of the [[Fist]],''' is a [[Natborn]] member of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[House Goliath]] and is among its eight most influential [[Alpha (House Goliath)|Alpha]]s within [[Hive Primus]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:Sparky3.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Ajex Gorgoth{{Fn|2}}]]
Because of his [[Natborn|natural]] birth, when compared to the majority of [[House Goliath]]'s [[Vatborn]], Gorgoth was marked for his cunning and ingenuity from an early age. His ability to craft weapons and armor from the scavenged scrap of the House's forge pits, gave Gorgoth a leg up in Goliath's brutal internal scuffles. Because of this, it was not long before he rose to become the [[Forge Tyrant]] of the [[Forge Lords]] [[gang]]. This dangerous lifestyle led Gorgoth to receive grievous injuries, but he was able to turn each wound into a greater strength, due to his self-made [[bionic]]s and crude [[power armor]]. This even included replacing his nose after it was bitten off in a fight. And anyone brave or stupid enough to mock the appearance of Gorgoth's new metal nose, found it buried in their forehead.{{Fn|1}}

He later became one of [[House Goliath]]'s [[Alpha (House Goliath)|Alpha]]s and master of its [[Fist (House Goliath)|Fist]] enclave settlement, after killing the previous Alpha, whose skull now adorns the trophy rack on Gorgoth's back. However the drudgery of the Fist's day-to-day management is far from the top of his schedule. Instead nowadays, Gorgoth can be usually found furthering Goliath's interests in [[Hive Primus]]' [[Underhive]], most often at the end of his massive [[power claw]]. He also has an unstoppable popularity with fellow Goliaths, which even has the House's [[Over-tyrant]] concerned. Though [[Varran Gor]] rules House Goliath, he is now following the Lord of the Fist's career closely, lest the Over-tyrant join Gorgoth's trophy rack.{{Fn|1}} 

