Akrep Xie.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''Akrep Xie''' is a [[Watch Master]] of the [[Deathwatch]] and the current [[Watch Commander|Commander]] of the [[Eye of Octos]] [[Watch Fortress]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

==Biography==
[[Image:AkrepXie.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Akrep Xie{{Fn|3a}}]]
Prior to joining the Deathwatch, Akrep Xie was a member of the [[Jade Scorpions]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|2}}{{Fn|3b}}

He formerly served as part of the forces of [[Watch Fortress]] [[Furor Shield]]. However, after fighting many battles against the [[Ork]]s of the [[Octarius Empire]], he was responsible for the commissioning of a new Watch Fortress called [[Eye of Octos]]; he argued that in the wake of [[Kryptman's Gambit]] that a dedicated fortress was necessary to hold back the greenskin tide and that Furor Shield was neither large nor focussed enough to suffice. Xie became Eye of Octos' first [[Watch Commander]] and has served in this capacity since.{{Fn|2}}

In [[M42]] he led the Eye of Octos' Deathwatch forces to aid the [[Pankallis Sub-sector]], after it was invaded by [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]]. Xie is currently fighting to cleanse the [[Xenos]] from the planet [[Death of Bianzeer]], in the [[Bianzeer's Hollow System]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

==Wargear==
Xie wields the [[Vigil Spear]] ''[[Xenos Mortis]]''.{{Fn|2}}

==Trivia==
