Alagon Mors.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Alagon Mors''' is the current [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Flames of Aries]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

Before that, he was a [[Greyshield]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] serving in the [[Indomitus Crusade]], who was chosen to lead a contingent of Greyshields as part of a [[Torchbearers|Torchbearer]] strike force sent to aid the Flames of Aries. Led by the [[Custodes]] [[Shield-Captain]] [[Galion Magethus]], the Torchbearers finally tracked the Flames down in the [[Ork]]-infested [[Villipan System]], where the Chapter were destroyed by the [[Xenos]]. The Torchbearers later found a group of 20 surviving Flames aboard the damaged [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Spear of Aries]]'', however, and rescued the remnants of the Chapter. With the Torchbearers' aid, the Flames of Aries were reborn, and with the [[Chapter Master]], [[Rigentus]], seemingly dead in battle with the Orks, Mors was chosen to command the Chapter. He and his former Greyshields then parted ways with the Torchbearers and left the Villipan System aboard the repaired ''Spear of Aries''.{{Fn|1}}

