Alar Serek.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Alar Serek''' was an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Lord General Militant]] and vaunted hero. He was commanding the [[Imperium]]'s campaign to save the worlds of the [[Bale Stars]], from an invasion by the [[Sighted]] [[Chaos Cult]].{{Fn|1a}}

During the campaign on [[Laxus Secundus]], Serek was apparently killed by an illness but miraculiously returned to life.{{Fn|1b}} He was implicated by [[Commissar]] [[Severina Raine]] in the conspiracy alongside [[General]] [[Kaspar Sylar]]. The heretics were seeking to utilize aid from the [[Sighted]] [[Chaos Cult]] as a means to obtain immortality. Raine and fellow Commissar [[Lukas Vander]] executed both Sylar and Serek. In the aftermath of the incident, Serek's treachery was covered up by the Imperium.{{Fn|1c}}


