Alaric DuPanya.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
{{ambig|subject=Planetary Governor|disambiguation=Alaric}}
'''Alaric DuPanya'''{{Fn|1a}} was the [[Planetary Governor]] of the [[Imperium|Imperial]] [[Agri World]] [[Viridia (Agri World)|Viridia]] during the [[Viridian Insurrection]].{{Fn|1b}}

The Viridia Insurrection was started as a series of protests against a tax on votive candles and incense that was blamed on DuPanya. Despite his claims that he had not even seen the proposals that instituted the tax, he became known as '''Alaric the Heretic''' by a significant proportion of the population. Even after the Insurrection was revealed to be the cover for a [[Genestealer Cult]] uprising{{Fn|1c}}, the nickname persisted, albeit in jest (much to DuPanya's consternation).{{Fn|1a}}

DuPanya had at least three daughters, the third of whom, [[Mira DuPanya]], was a [[Colonel]] of Viridia's [[Planetary Defence Forces]].{{Fn|1c}}

