Alaric Nightrunner.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''Alaric Nightrunner''' was a [[Wolf Lord]] of the [[Silent Howlers]] [[Great Company]] of the [[Space Wolves]] as of the time of the 30th [[Great Hunt]].{{Fn|1}}

== History ==

During the 30th Great Hunt, the Great Companies of the Space Wolves each set out on a quest to achieve great deeds. Alaric went to the [[Ghoul Stars]] with his company, accompanied by [[Njal Stormcaller]]. There they encountered a great [[Tyranid]] [[hive ship]] that pursued them, looking to devour their ship [[Canis Pax]]. After rebuffing multiple boarding attempts by the Tyranid organisms, Alaric opted to launch a [[cyclonic torpedo]] at the hive ship while Njal Stormcaller shrouded it in a illusion, making it look like a [[Stormwolf]] gunship with Alaric himself perched on top holding his spear in challenge. The hive ship then swallowed the torpedo whole and the ensuing detonation disoriented the ship and allowed the Space Wolves to kill it and bring its gigantic jawbone back to [[The Fang]] as a trophy.{{Fn|1}}


