Alarielle.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Alarielle''' is a member of the [[Asuryani]] species.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
She was among{{Fn|1}} the Asuryani's forces that invaded the [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the [[Imperium]] later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the [[Xenos]]{{Fn|2}} and Alarielle was made one of its priority targets. She was also among those that the [[Ordo Xenos]] gathered information on during the conflict, but it was made classified by the Ordo.{{Fn|1}} Though the Asuryani were eventually defeated by the Imperium,{{Fn|2}} Alarielle survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}} 
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Alarielle'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]] by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Grapevine Mills''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Grapevine, Texas, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}

