Alexander Mane.wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}}
'''Alexander Mane''' is a legendary [[Inquisitor]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was part{{Fn|1}} of the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]], which was launched to defend the [[Chinchare sub-sector]] from an invasion by the [[Asuryani]] and [[Drukhari]]. The [[Xenos]] had began their attack in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]] and among them{{Fn|2}} was the [[Exarch]] [[Maurtear]]. The Exarch would become known as the '''Scourge of the [[Burnicus Subsector]]''' for his attacks upon it and this led Mane to declare Maurtear '''Xenos Purgatus'''. Once this was placed upon the Exarch, no effort was spared to track down and kill Maurtear and his warriors.{{Fn|1}} However while the Xenos were eventually defeated by the Imperium's forces,{{Fn|2}} the Exarch survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}
