Alexei Lev Tieron.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Alexei Lev Tieron''' was the [[Chancellor of the Senatorum Imperialis]] on [[Terra]], at the time of the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}} 
==History==
While not a [[High Lord]], the position nonetheless made Tieron extremely powerful and he gained significant influence over his eighty year tenure as [[Chancellor of the Senatorum Imperialis|Chancellor]]. During the [[13th Black Crusade]], Tieron was a key political player in pushing for the dissolution of the [[Edict of Restraint]] that kept the [[Adeptus Custodes]] bound to [[Terra]].{{Fn|1a}}

During the [[Battle of Luna]], Tieron was the first [[Adeptus Terra]] official to meet with the reborn [[Primarch]] [[Roboute Guilliman]]. After the [[Battle of Lion's Gate]], he was made Guilliman's personal [[Remembrancer]]{{Fn|1b}} and Tieron's aid and occasional lover [[Anna-Murza Jek]], replaced him as [[Chancellor of the Senatorum Imperialis]].{{Fn|2a}} However due to his poor physical condition, Tieron ultimately did not follow Guilliman into the [[Indomitus Crusade]], as he thought he may not survive the campaign. While remaining on Terra, though, Tieron later aided his former acolyte Jek against the rebellion plotted by the [[Hexarchy]].{{Fn|2b}}

