'''Alfus Rekorik Smigh''' is a member of the [[Logos Historica Verita]].{{Fn|1}}

He was appointed to write a comprehensive history of [[Battle Group Kallides]]' war against the [[Necron]]s in the [[Pariah Nexus]]. Smigh succeeded in his task and completed the multi-volume series named ''[[The Definitive Account Of The War For The Pariah Nexus]]''. He noted, however, that the [[Darkspires]] [[Chapter]] refused to answer his questions about the key part they played in defending [[Paradyce II]] from the Necrons. While this annoyed Smigh, he noted that the Chapter was loyal to the [[Imperium]] and must have had a good reason for their secrecy.{{Fn|1}}

