All-Seer.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
The '''All-Seer''' was a [[Tau Commander|Commander]] in the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} its [[Third Sphere of Expansion]] forces{{Fn|2}} that invaded the [[Imperial]] [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|3}} The All-Seer had the ability to detect and strike at weaknesses in his foes' defenses to lethal effect. The Imperial Commanders could not see these flaws and the All-Seer's attacks would cause their forces to collapse before the [[T'au Empire]]. He would use this ability to great affect during the invasions and the [[Tau Commander|Commander]] took part in key defeats for the Imperium along the Damocles Gulf.{{Fn|1}} However the [[Xenos]] were later attacked by the [[Imperium]] in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Mont'shi Campaign]]{{Fn|3}} and the All-Seer was made a priority target. He would be captured by Imperial forces during the conflict and was studied by it. The Commander was then executed by the Imperium, once it was done with him.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''All-Seer'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]] by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Oakridge''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''San Jose, California, USA'''.{{Fn|4}}

