Allectius.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Allectius''' is an [[Ultramarines]] [[Assault Intercessor]] [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[Indomitus Crusade]], who is now the acting [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] of the [[Chapter]]'s surviving forces on [[Cassothea]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
[[File:Nexus cover art.jpeg|right|thumb|Allectius {{Fn|1b}}]]
He was among those [[Primaris Space Marines]] awoken as the [[Indomitus Crusade]] began and was later among [[Space Marine Company|Company]] worth of [[Ultramarines]] sent to defend [[Cassothea]]. The world lays within the [[Pariah Nexus]] and was being invaded by hordes of [[Necron]], which vastly outnumbered the Ultramarines. Though the Crusade's command had ordered that Cassothea most not fall to the [[Xenos]], the war went badly quickly. Within only days of arriving there, the senior of the two [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]]s leading the Company was killed by the Necrons and Lieutenant [[Falerius]] took command of the Company. He ordered the Ultramarines to focus on saving Cassothea's capital city, '''Macuth''', but months later, the Necron had destroyed most of it.{{Fn|1a}}

Many of the city's population had been massacred as well, along with over half of the Ultramarines. With no way to stop the Necron hordes from repairing themselves and with the last Crusade supply ship crashing into Cassothea, the order was given to evacuate the world. Soon afterwards, Falerius would be killed by the Necron, but the Lieutenant had told [[Chaplain]] [[Sisenna]] before hand, that upon his death Allectius was to take command. This surprised Allectius, after the Chaplain told him, as [[Fulgentius]] was the most senior of the surviving [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeants]]. Sisenna confirmed it, though, and stated the other Sergeants had agreed to abide by the late Falerius' wishes.{{Fn|1a}} 

==Sources==
*1: [[Nexus (Novella)]]
**{{Endn|1a}}: Chapter 1
