Allerdyce.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Allerdyce''' is a grim [[Black Templars]] [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Before his interment, Allderdyce was a veteran [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]] in his [[Chapter]], who rose in rank and power due to his tactical knowlege and undying hatred of [[Xenos]]. Half of the many successful [[Crusade]]s he took part in were against these foes and Allerdyce repeatedly answered the call to combat any Xenos threat. Once he did, the Marshal would then face off against their leaders in single combat. When the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]] began, Allerdyce spearheaded the [[Imperium]]'s attack against its Xenos foes,{{Fn|1}} and took part in the [[Gathrog Campaign]].{{Fn|2}} He was later critically wounded in combat{{Fn|1}} against the [[Orks]] of the [[Green Kroosade]]{{Fn|2}} and this led Allerdyce to be interred within a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]]. He would then rise once more to continue fighting in the Dark Crusade and survived the end of the conflict.{{Fn|1}}
