Allysa Collack.wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}}
'''Allysa Collack''' was a [[Puritan]] [[Inquisitor]] and was part of a large [[Inquisition Conclave]], during the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

The [[Inquisition Conclave|Conclave]] was formed to investigate the [[Sentinel Worlds]], early in the [[13th Black Crusade|Crusade]], after the region suffered strange power surges and an [[Emperor's Tarot]] reading foresaw dire omens there. Once they arrived, the Conclave's [[Inquisitors]] soon discovered that the forces of [[Chaos]] had activated an ancient [[Aeldari]] [[Warp Gate]]. Worse still, the Gate was being used to transport a powerful [[Daemon Prince]] into [[Realspace]]. This led the Conclave to do battle against the Chaos forces and both sides were also attacked by the Aeldari as well. However, the Conclave was not a united front in the battle and its different factions could not agree on a single course of action. As a result of this schism, the [[Radical]] Inquisitor [[Cromwell]] was declared a [[Traitor]] and Collack entered the Warp Gate to stop the Daemon Prince from materializing. Though she was successful in preventing the Prince from entering Realspace, the [[Puritan]] Inquisitor was declared lost afterwards.{{Fn|1}}
