Alna Klaren.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Alna Klaren''' was a [[Guardsman]] of the [[22nd Armageddon Steel Legion]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]]. She served during the [[Third War for Armageddon|Third Armageddon War]] under [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] [[Veit Morena]], acting as the driver for the [[Leman Russ Vanquisher]] ''[[Storm of the Wastes]]''.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
At one point during the war, Morena's squadron was recalled from [[Anaon]] to [[Hive Tartarus]]. They also had the honour of transporting [[Commissar]] [[Sebastian Yarrick]], who was also returning to Tartarus, but was unable to travel by air owing to a nearby pitched battle between [[Imperial Aircraft|Imperial]] and [[Ork Aircraft]]. Yarrick rode with Captain Morena and his crew aboard ''Storm of the Wastes''.{{Fn|1}}

At one point in the journey, the squadron spotted [[Ork]] [[Gargant]]s moving towards Tartarus. Morena had [[Jaro Berne|Berne]] [[vox]] ahead to Tartarus to warn them while ordering Klaren to lead the squadron east through a hilly region, giving them cover while they detoured around the Gargants. However, the tanks were eventually seen by a number of Ork [[Bomber]]s, which attacked the squadron. The tanks were destroyed, with the ''Storm'' being blown upside down in the attack, killing all of the crew and leaving Yarrick the only survivor.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
