'''Alphion''' is a [[Deathwatch Lieutenant]], who is a highly skilled warrior, able tactician and also the commander of the [[Vigil Force Alphion]] strike force.{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
He first assembled the [[Deathwatch]] [[Apothecary]] [[Krenn]] and the [[Vigil Force Alphion|Vigil Force]]'s other members, to eradicate [[Malachote Prime]]'s [[Xenos]] infestation and the [[Deathwatch Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] now continues to lead them against other threats{{Fn|1a}}. In battle, Alphion is able to coordinate the formidable strike force's fire power, even as he strides into their foes and uses his power sword to cut down the mightiest Xenos warrior.{{Fn|1b}}

