Althalos.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Althalos''' was a [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Dark Angels]] Legion during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]] and Castellan of the [[Star Fort]] ''[[Chimaera]]''.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Althalos was assigned Castellan of the Star Fort ''Chimaera'' by [[Luther]] and send with a fleet to the [[Alaxxes Nebula]] to conquer worlds. He and his fleet were in the nebula for fifty-nine years before the nebula became a battleground for a war between the [[Space Wolves]] and [[Alpha Legion]]. During the [[Battle of the Alaxxes Nebula]], not knowing which legion was on the loyalist side, Althalos decided to send out two spies. [[Ormand]] was sent to the ''[[Hrafnkel]]'' to spy on the Space Wolves, while an unknown other spy was send to the ''[[Alpha]]'' to spy on the Alpha Legion. Ormand reported the Space Wolves' continued loyalty to the Emperor and Althalos ordered his star fort and fleet to support the wolves against the Alpha Legion.{{Fn|1}}

After the Dark Angels won the battle, Althalos requested the primarch [[Leman Russ]] to join him on the ''Chimaera''. The two forged an alliance and a trade. Althalos supplied the severly wounded Space Wolves fleet with materials and weapons, while Leman Russ provided information about the greater civil war.{{Fn|1}}

After this meeting Althalos returned to [[Caliban]].{{Fn|1}}

