Amfell Shenn.wikitext:
{{SalamandersPortal}}
{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"The fire was stoked. We now burn brighter than ever."'''<br>- Amfell Shenn'''''{{Fn|1}}
|align = center
|width = 19em
}}
'''Amfell Shenn, the Saturnine Flame,''' was a [[Saturnine Terminator]] [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
[[Image:AmfellShenn.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Amfell Shenn{{Fn|1}}]]
In the wake of the [[Horus Heresy|Hershey's]] [[Dropsite Massacre]], Shenn sought to endure the [[Salamanders]]' [[Shattered Legion|shattering]], and to sear the [[Traitor]]s from the [[galaxy]]. However, the [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]]'s wounds ran deep and he was wracked with fury for what had befallen his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]. His quest became driven by vengeance, as a result of this, and he was willing to sacrifice anything to obtain it. This lasted, until Sheen returned to the Salamanders' [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]], [[Nocturne]], in order to rally his [[battle brother]]s for a campaign of retribution against the Traitors. However, the Praetor's attitude changed, as he stood before the flames of a [[Promethean Cult]] ritual pyre.{{Fn|1}} 

Its fires rekindled the [[Promethean Cult|teachings]] of their lost [[Primarch]], [[Vulkan]], within Shenn and he began working within his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion's]] forge afterwards. Each strike of the [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor's]] hammer not only tempered the steel he worked on, but also his rage. It was soon turned into resolve and Shenn vowed that if he was to carry on Vulkan's legacy, then his war against the [[Traitor]]s would be driven by justice and not vengeance. With his path now set, Shenn offered to volunteer himself to further test the experimental [[Saturnine Armour|Saturnine Power Armour]] in battle. After becoming a Saturnine [[Praetor]], he then mustered the Salamanders in order to turn the oath breaking Traitors to ashes. As his Legion sought to right the wrongs committed against them, Shenn always stood in the front lines of the Salamanders' battle. He was ruthless against their foes, but the Saturnine Praetor also became a beacon for the [[Shattered Legion|scattered members]] of his Legion. In doing so, Shenn became a reminder that a flame burns the brightest, when it is the darkest.{{Fn|1}}

