Amhetra.wikitext:
[[Image:Amhetra.jpg|thumb|right|250px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
''' Amhetra the Hierarchitectron''' is a [[Necron]] [[Cryptek]] of the [[Geomancy]] discipline.{{Fn|1}}

Affiliated with the [[Sautekh Dynasty]], she was slumbering on the [[Tomb World]] of [[Somneft]] until its [[Deep Spirit|master program]] reawakened her in order to reverse its deterioration. Amhetra quickly reversed the situation, but by [[M41]] had become eccentric and crazed. She usurped the Master Program and sought to prevent the reawakening of Somneft's own nobility in order to retain her power. She soon engaged in experimentations on the slumbering population and even created morbid art displays with their sleeping bodies. Amhetra also seeks out ancient technological relics nearby to Somneft, seeking to expand her power to that of a demigod.{{Fn|1}}

As Amhetra attempted to manipulate the master program into giving her access to the personal domains of the tomb's nobility and rival Crypteks, Somneft was raided by the [[Death Watch]] [[Team Vaskovian]].{{Fn|1}}

