Amlodhi Skarssen Skarssensson.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was [[Wolf Lord]] of the [[Space Wolves]] 5th [[Great Company]] during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}}

After several messages by [[Leman Russ (Primarch)|Leman Russ]] were ignored by [[Magnus the Red]]{{Fn|1b}}, Skarssen was eventually sent as an emissary to demand the [[Thousand Sons]] leave [[Aghoru]] aid the Space Wolves in the [[Ark Reach Cluster]]. Due to his blatant rudeness Magnus psychically domineered him to the point of submission.{{Fn|1c}} Skarssen and his warriors then join the Thousand Sons in investigating a nearby valley{{Fn|1d}}, and the Astartes faced a pair of corrupted [[Aeldari]] [[Titan]]s.{{Fn|1e}}{{Fn|1f}} He also took part in [[Battle of the Mountain|the battle]] against a [[Daemon]] under the world's artificial Mountain and, once satisfied that his mission was fulfilled, returned to the Ark Reach Cluster.{{Fn|1g}}{{Fn|1h}}

There, he first butted heads with the Thousand Sons when Magnus ordered a local library to be preserved against Russ's wishes to destroy everything after the last bastion of resistance fell, witnessing the first case of flesh change since the XV had been reunited with its [[Primarch]].{{Fn|1i}} The 5th Great Company was subsequently deployed during the [[Burning of Prospero]].{{Fn|1j}}{{Fn|2}}

Later, Skarssensson commanded a portion of the Space Wolves during the [[Battle of Yarant]].{{Fn|3}}

