Amon Cull.wikitext:
{{NightLordsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''', the '''Prince of Thorns''', was a [[Chaos Lord]] of the [[Night Lord]]s.{{Fn|1a}} 

As a child, Amon was adopted by the noble [[House Cull]] on [[Hive Apraxis]] on [[Savlar]]. As a child, his world was invaded by Night Lords and during the chaos Amon was overcome by [[Daemon]]ic voices in his head and slaughtered his family. Afterwards, he was taken and inducted into the Night Lords himself.{{Fn|1a}}

As a warband leader alongside the [[Sorcerer]] [[Shadraith]], Cull and his warband planned to capture [[Mika Doren Skell]], a young [[Psyker]] on [[Zartak]], and use him as a vessel in order to summon their [[Daemon]]ic master, [[Bar'ghul]].{{Fn|1a}} During the invasion of Zartak, Cull and his warband come into battle with the [[Carcharodons]] 3rd Company under [[Bail Sharr]] and [[Chief Librarian]] [[Te Kahurangi]]. In the end, Cull and Shadraith are successful in capturing Skell as well as Chief Librarian Te and begin their ritual in Zartak's [[Arbites]] Precinct-Fortress.{{Fn|1b}} However despite victory being close at hand, Cull interrupts the ritual when he senses the time is right to betray and kill Shadraith in order to eliminate a potential rival.{{Fn|1c}} This allows Skell to break free with Te's help, and he deactivates the Fortresses [[Void Shield]]s which allows the Carcharodons under Sharr to teleport inside. In the subsequent battle, Cull incapacitates Sharr but is crushed by debris unleashed by Te Kahurangi.{{Fn|1d}} 

