Amontar.wikitext:
{{NecronsPortal}}
'''Amontar''' is a [[Necron Lord]] a ruler of [[Xanderat]], serving under the Overlord [[Turakhin]].{{Fn|1}}

== Overview ==
Amontar attended feasts on [[Borsis]], sitting on the left-hand seat next to his overlord. Despite of being a ruler of an entire planet, he was mesmerised by a crystal goblet in a possession of his master.

He plotted a poisoning of his overlord by the [[Harapti]] wine, but the attempt was accidentally foiled by [[Khetmes]] tripping the wine goblet over.

He continued his plot in a second attempt, eventually foiled by [[Heqiroth]]. In a revenge he stabbed Heqiroth with his poisoned blade as Heqiroth was being granted a title of Overlord.{{Fn|1}}

== Personality ==
Amontar was impatient and ambitious. Willing to betray even friends and co-conspirators to achieve his goals.{{Fn|1}}

== Wargear ==
He used an envenomed dagger. He was also known for his skills in preparing poisons able to kill other [[Necrons]].{{Fn|1}}

