==History==
She was almost successful in [[Battle of Delugen|purging the infestation]], until Starseeker's forces were ultimately driven off by the [[Black Templars]] [[Chapter]]. This allowed the surviving population of [[Delugen]] to escape, which included the remnants of [[Cult Tendricul]]. Within a year, the [[Genestealer Cult]]'s symbols were seen on a dozen planets, including the [[Eldar]] [[Maiden World]] [[Virgose]].{{Fn|1}}

