Ancaeus.wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Ancaeus''' is a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[Blood Angels]] [[Chapter]] and is an experienced leader.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
[[Image:Ancaeus.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
Once considered a candidate for the [[Sanguinary Cult]], Ancaeus is devoted to his duty and holds his obligations to his [[Chapter]], his [[Battle Brother]]s, and the [[Imperium]] higher than any amount of personal glory. Ancaeus believes individual honor is secondary to the safety of the [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]]'s men and mission, and this brings him into conflict with his formerly close friend [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Kazarion]]. He was later serving with a fleet aboard the [[Sword of Baal]], when its ships were enveloped by the birth of the [[Great Rift]]. The giant [[Warp Storm]] damaged the [[Strike Cruiser]] and killed many of its crew, before only the Sword of Baal managed to escape back to [[Realspace]].{{Fn|1}}

Ancaeus was among the Blood Angels who survived the journey, when the Strike Cruiser found itself stranded above the world [[Niades]]. Soon after their arrival, however, a high priority transmission from the world reached the Sword of Baal. Due to the loss of so many of the Strike Cruiser's Blood Angels, its [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], [[Orpheo]], decided to investigate the transmission on his own and descended to Niades. However after he arrived, the Captain was set upon by [[Genestealers]] and the Sword of Baal lost contact with Orpheo. This prompted Ancaeus, [[Kazarion]] and most of the surviving Blood Angels to begin searching Niades for the missing Captain.{{Fn|1}}

==Notes==
''Ancaeus'' is a character in the [[Angels of Death (Animated Series)]].{{Fn|1}}

