Angelica.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Angelica''' is an [[Order of the Argent Shroud|Argent Shroud]] [[Zephyrim]] [[Sister Superior|Superior]], who is currently serving in the [[Daemenor Crusade]] as part of [[Canoness Preceptor]] [[Eleanor Blanche|Blance]]'s [[War of Faith]].{{Fn|3}}

==History==
Her journey there began in the aftermath of the [[Great Rift]]'s creation, when Angelica was struck by a vision from the [[Emperor]]. It warned that [[Canoness]] [[Eleanor Blanche|Blanche]]'s forces were in danger on [[Daemenor (Cardinal World)|Daemenor]] and needed immediate aid. Angelica reacted quickly to this and led the [[Order of the Argent Shroud|Argent Shroud]] [[Adepta Sororitas|Sororitas]] she had been serving with, to rescue the Canoness. Miraculously, they were joined by the [[Living Saint]] [[Celestine]] and the Sororitas later reached Blanche's forces, who were being attacked by [[Heretics]]. With the combined might of the Argent Shroud and Saint Celestine, the Heretics were killed and the Crusade Force was saved. Afterwards Celestine, Angelica and the Sororitas they brought with them, would join Blanche's efforts to cleanse Daemenor of its Heresy.{{Fn|1}}

They succeeded in doing so and afterwards, [[Canoness]] [[Eleanor Blanche|Blanche]] led her Sisters to [[Sanctuary 101]]. She sought to reconsecrate the world for the [[Imperium]], after it was lost in the aftermath of the [[Great Rift]]'s creation. However the [[Necron]]s' [[Thokt Dynasty]] sought to claim the world as well and was led by its [[Necron Overlord|Overlord]] [[Onryx]]{{Fn|2}}. Despite the [[Order of the Argent Shroud|Argent Shroud]]'s fierce efforts, they were defeated and Blanche's surviving Sisters escaped back to [[Daemenor (Cardinal World)|Daemenor]]. It was being used as a staging post for the [[Daemenor Crusade]] and despite their defeat, Eleanor was promoted to [[Canoness Preceptor]] and given command of the Crusade's [[War of Faith]]. Angelica and the other surviving Argent Shroud Sisters, joined the Canoness and still serve under Blanche's command.{{Fn|3}}

