'''Angelus''' is a [[Blood Angels]] [[Terminator Sergeant]], who always strives to live up to his [[Chapter]]'s glorious legacy of defending the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1b}}

==History==
He is also an accomplished leader, who inspires those who serve with him to acts of great heroism in battle. In [[M42]], Angelus was among the [[Blood Angels]]{{Fn|1b}} that defended the [[Imperium]]'s worlds in the [[Vertex Sector]]. When the vital world of [[Vertex (World)|Vertex]] suffered an [[Ork]] invasion{{Fn|1a}} the Blood Angels{{Fn|1b}} and several [[Space Marine Chapter]]s came to its defence.{{Fn|1a}} Angelus would do battle with the invading Orks{{Fn|1b}}, but his mission changed when the [[Xenos]] found a weakness in the [[Hive City]] of '''Acastus'''' defences. It had been protected during the invasion by a [[Void Shield|Void Shield network]], which was projected from an armoured bunker designated '''Shield Generator Gamma-9'''. However the Orks would discover this and several hordes were sent to destroy it, so the Xenos could invade the Hive City.{{Fn|1a}} 

The [[Chapter]]s became aware of the danger{{Fn|1a}} and each sent a [[Terminator]] to protect the [[Void Shield|Shield Generator]]. Angelus was sent by the [[Blood Angels]] to defend it and he was joined by the [[Imperial Fist]] [[Etrus]], the [[Salamanders|Salamander]] [[Magmus]], the [[Space Wolf]] [[Stormheart]] and the [[Ultramarine]] [[Lucian (Ultramarines)|Lucian]].{{Fn|1b}} Though they numbered only five, in the close confines of the armoured bunker, these Terminator-armoured warriors would be in their element. None would allow the Orks access to '''Shield Generator Gamma-9''', without a fierce battle.{{Fn|1a}} 

