Scattered across time after the [[destruction of Caliban]], ten thousand years later Anovel again met with Astelan and was briefly part of his conspiracy with [[Typhus]] to use the [[Tuchulcha]] engine to create an army of Fallen and [[Death Guard]]. Anovel was ultimately captured by the Dark Angels and was interrogated by [[Sapphon]], who convinced him to turn against Astelan. Shortly after the captured [[Cypher]] was brought into the room and he quickly snapped Anovel's neck with his own shackles. As he died, Anovel's corruption by the [[Chaos God]] [[Nurgle]] manifested, his body rapidly decaying and releasing yellow dust with the last breath from his rotting lungs.{{Fn|1}}

