Apocrypha (Librarian).wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Apocrypha''' is a [[Space Marine]] [[Librarian]] from an unknown [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was presumed to have died in the final cataclysmic battles of the [[Third War of Armageddon]], but Apocrypha survived and had much of his flesh replaced with [[bionic|bionic augmentations]]. The [[Librarian]]'s soul burns brightly with his hatred of [[Xenos]] and he unleashed this upon{{Fn|1}} the [[Asuryani]]{{Fn|2}} who stood in his way during{{Fn|1}} the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|3}} [[Kith Campaign]].{{Fn|2}} Apocrypha was among those taking part in the conflict that the [[Ordo Xenos]] gathered information on, but his Chapter's name was made classified by the Ordo. The Kith Campaign eventually ended in a great victory for the Imperium{{Fn|3}} and Apocrypha survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}
