In the last days of the Siege, Apollo would be among the [[Imperial]] forces that defended the [[Imperial_Palace#Inner_Palace|inner]] [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Delphic Battlement]].{{Fn|1a}} This led directly to the [[Emperor]]'s domain within the [[Sanctum Imperialis]], however, and when the Battlement fell to [[Horus]]' hordes, the Sanctum's [[Eternity Gate (Imperial)|Eternity Gate]] was ordered closed. It is not clear, though, if Apollo was killed defending the Battlement or if he was among the Imperial forces that managed to enter the Sanctum, before the Gate was sealed.{{Fn|1b}}

