{{BloodRavensPortal}}
[[Image:Apollo diomedes.png|right|thumb|Apollo Diomedes]]
'''Apollo Diomedes''' is the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Blood Ravens]] [[Space Marine Honour Guard Squad|Honour Guard]]. Previously, he commanded the [[1st Company (Blood Ravens)|First Company]] for almost two centuries.{{Fn|1}}

Diomedes's most famous victory came on the ravaged [[penal world]] of [[Obscurus (World)|Obscurus]]. On the same day, he and his brothers defeated the [[Ork]] [[Warboss]] [[Manstompa Megakilla]] and the [[Chaos Sorcerer]] [[Anupharis|Anupharis the Cruel]]. After that victory Diomedes was elevated to the command of the [[Chapter Master|Chapter Master's]] own honour guard, becoming [[Azariah Kyras|Azariah Kyras's]] most public agent among the Chapter's far-flung battle brothers.{{Fn|1}}

Although not corrupted himself, he, acting under orders from Master Kyras, aided the heretical [[Apothecary]] [[Galan]] in opposing the efforts of Force Commander [[Aramus]], who had been declared a renegade, to destroy Galan's Stronghold.{{Fn|1}}

He returned, 10 years later, to discover the truth with [[Cyrus]] and [[Martellus]].

