'''Ar'ghurak the Beheader of Saints''' is a [[World Eaters]] [[Chaos Lord]] who rides a [[Juggernaut]] into battle. He is the current leader of the [[Gore-forged]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|1}} 

==History==
The only way a [[Gore-forged]] leader maintains his position is by dominating his followers, but should a new champion join the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]], then a power struggle is all but guaranteed to break out. Such is the case now, as Ar'ghurak's command has been threatened with the recent arrival of the [[Daemon Prince]] [[Vorghor]]. The [[Daemon]] has gathered a following amongst the Gore-Forged, who called themselves the [[Iron Butchers (Warband)|Iron Butchers]], and it is only a matter of time until Vorghor challenges Ar'ghurak's leadership of the Warband.{{Fn|1}}

