Near the end of the Siege, he fought to defend the [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Sanctum Imperialis]], but was among the [[Imperium]]'s forces left stranded after the closing of the [[Eternity Gate (Imperial)|Eternity Gate]]. Now having no means to escape or receive reinforcements, the remaining Imperials fought on against hordes of [[Traitor Legion]]s, [[Heretics]], [[Mutant]]s and [[Daemons]]. During these battles, Ari'i stood beside his fellow [[Salamanders]] [[Ma'ula]] and [[Hema]], as they held a position within the Imperial Palace's '''Propinquity Court'''. They fought off three attacks by the [[Death Guard]], but only survived a fourth when the [[Imperial Knights]] of [[House Cadmus]] came to the Salamanders' aid.{{Fn|1}}

