{{HowlingGriffonsPortal}}
{{ambig|subject=Howling Griffons Chaplain Dreadnought|disambiguation=Armand}}
[[Image:ChaplainDreadnought.jpg|thumb|right|250px|[[Chaplain Dreadnought]] Armand Titus during the [[Badab War]]{{Fn|1b}}]]
{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"Here we stand and here shall we die, unbroken and unbowed, though the very hand of death itself come for us, we will spit our defiance to the end!"'''''<br>''-Armand Titus during the last stand on '''Khymara Ellipsis'''''{{Fn|1a}}
|}}
'''Armand Titus''' was a [[Chaplain]] of the [[Howling Griffons]].{{Fn|1a}}

In 143.[[M41]], Titus, along with the 4th Company, led the final assault against the renegade [[General]] [[Jorun]] and his forces during the [[Jorun Retaliation]]. Fighting his way through renegade guard, [[Ogryn]] and [[Dark Eldar]], he was wounded by xenos poisons; despite this he broke through to face General Jorun and delivered the [[Emperor]]'s justice. Upon returning to [[Mancora]] Titus was encased in a [[dreadnought]] to continue his service to the Chapter.{{Fn|1a}}  

Titus continued to serve with the 4th [[Space Marine Company|Company]] throughout M41, including the campaign in the [[Caradryad system]] and into the [[Badab War]].{{Fn|1a}}

He was present on [[Khymara]] when the [[Executioners]] assaulted the moon base and was one of the large number of losses.{{Fn|1a}} The surviving Howling Griffons found the wreck of Titus' Dreadnought laid out, surrounded by a ring of broken weapons, a shattered Executioners' standard placed in the war machine's lifeless grasp.{{Fn|1b}}

