Apart from the decorative inscriptions and designs that cover Arn Therod's [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]] shell the [[Hagalaz]] rune, the mark of the [[Hrimthursar]], the most hateful of the [[Space Wolves]]' Dreadnoughts (or ''[[Sons of Ymir]]'', as they themselves called their Dreadnought cadres), can be seen on the left greave.{{Fn|1}}

