'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Tactical Support Squad|Tactical Support Legionary]] of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], serving in the 34th Squad of the [[140th Company (Imperial Fists Legion)|140th Company]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Just prior to the [[Battle of Phall]], the 140th company were recalled from reconciliation operations in the [[Hangman Void]]. 34th Squad was assigned to the warship ''[[Lacedaemon]]''; this was perceived as a high honour, because the ''Lacedaemon'' was a veteran of the first expeditions of the VII Legion in the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

During the battle, several dozen warriors of the 140th Company died when the ''Lacedaemon'' suffered a catastrophic breach. There is information that Legionary Arnfried and his battle brothers fought off several attempts by the [[Iron Warriors]] to board the ''Lacedaemon'', but nothing is known about their further courageous acts. The ship was destroyed during the exit from the battle with the Iron Warriors fleet and it is unlikely that Arnfried or any from the 140th Company could have survived the massacre.{{Fn|1}}

==Wargear==
Arnfried wore a suit of [[MK3|Mk 3 armour]] and was armed with a [[Meltagun|Primus MkII pattern meltagun]] and a [[Phaestos (Forge World)|Phaestos]]-pattern [[Imperial Flamer|flamer]].{{Fn|1}}

