Arrakesh Hadyaemus.wikitext:
{{TzeentchPortal}}{{ThousandSonsPortal}}
'''Arrakesh Hadyaemus''' was a [[Thousand Sons]] [[Sorcerer]] active during the [[War for the Tri-forge Cluster]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
He was among the forces that had seized control of the [[Imperium of Man|Imperium]]'s [[Tri-forge Cluster]] in [[M42]], before the [[Chaos_Space_Marine#Traitor_Legions|Traitor Legion]] clashed with the [[Death Guard]], when the latter launched their own invasion as part of [[Typhus the Traveler]]'s [[Charadon Campaign]].{{Fn|1}}

Hadyameus was stationed on [[Duos]], which had been heavily transformed by [[Tzeentch]]'s powers, and he had command of the [[Scarab Occult Terminator]]s protecting the '''Amethyst Palace'''. The Palace was an ever-shifting quartz maze and this undid the Death Guard who invaded it. They were ground down by ambushes laid out by the Scarab Occult and Hadyaemus revealed himself only when a few Death Guard remained alive. He then used his [[Warp]] powers to destroy the invaders and their ashes were soon wiped away by the Amethyst Palace's magic.{{Fn|1}}  

