Artamax.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Artamax''' is a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] of the [[Raptors (Chapter)|Raptors]]' [[3rd Company (Raptors)|3rd Company]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2c}}

==History==
After [[Cao Quo]] fell to an invasion by the [[T'au Empire]]'s [[Fifth Sphere of Expansion]], Artamax infiltrated the former [[Imperial]] world and began a insurrection against the [[Xenos]].{{Fn|1}} His campaign sought not to just rally [[Human]] rebels on Cao Quo against their Tau rulers, but to undermine the entire [[Tau'va]] by using a [[Callidus Assassin]] impersonating the [[Ethereal]] [[Yor'i]] to sponsor the renegade [[Syra]] group. Artamax saw the Greater Good as fragile and thought he could poison the entire Tau Empire with discontent with his actions on Cao Quo.{{Fn|2a}}

During the battles against the [[Elemental Council]] organized by the impersonator Yor'i to recover [[Aun'ui Kir'qath]], an Ethereal who was investigating the truth of his conspiracy, Artamax willingly allows himself to be captured and put into stasis.{{Fn|2b}} Aboard the Tau floating forward operating base above Cao Quo, Artamax was then set free by Yor'i as the Imperials launched an attack on the facility.{{Fn|2b}} Recovering his [[Power Armour]] at a location provided by Yor'i, Artamax came into battle with the Elemental Council operatives [[Swordlight]] and [[Ke]]. Thanks to Ke being an [[Earth Caste]] engineer, she was able to jump on Artamax's armour interface and interfere with it, causing it to jam. This gave Swordlight the time needed to slash Artamax's throat.{{Fn|2a}}

