Artarion.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Artarion''' was a [[Space Marine]] of the [[Black Templars]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
At one time, Artarion served the Chapter as a [[Thunderhawk]] pilot. He is known to have been part of the [[Vinculus Crusade]], taking part in the [[Battle of Fire and Blood]]. At the end of the battle, while the fortress of [[Apex]] was collapsing around the last of the surviving Black Templars, Artarion was the last pilot to leave, allowing [[High Marshal (Black Templars)|High Marshal]] [[Ludoldus]], [[Reclusiarch]] [[Mordred (Reclusiarch)|Mordred]] and [[Sword Brother]] [[Merek Grimaldus|Grimaldus]] to evacuate.{{Fn|2}}

Some time later, Artarion would go on to serve Grimaldus directly as the [[banner bearer]] of his [[Reclusiam Command Squad|command squad]], [[Squad Grimaldus]].{{Fn|1a}} He met his end during the [[Helsreach Crusade]], falling against a horde of [[ork]]s while defending the [[Temple of the Emperor Ascendant]].{{Fn|1b}}

