Artemidorus.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
[[Image:Aremidorus.jpg|thumb|right|{{PAGENAME}}'s [[Knight Crusader]], the ''[[Unbowed]]'']]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Baron|Knight Baron]] of [[House Terryn]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[Tybalt]], [[High King]] of House Terryn, has chosen Baron Artemidorus to act as a member of his House's [[Exalted Court]]: more specifically, Artemidorus is Tybalt's [[Herald (Knight)|Herald]]. In House Terryn the Herald (also known as the '''All-hailer''' or '''Executor of Orders''') has several duties. On the battlefield, Artemidorus ensures that the fanfare (trumpet-blasts blared through his [[vox]]-grilles) befits each Knight who enters the battlefield. It is also his duty to issue warnings of enemy attacks, relay vox orders and lay down covering fire.{{Fn|1}}

In recognition of Artemidorus's station, his [[Knight Crusader]], the ''[[Unbowed]]'', is marked with a pair of vertical cream stripes over the top of his carapace (denoting his status as a Baron) and the top edge of his Knight's tilting plate has a cream-coloured crenellation (signifying that he is his House's Herald).{{Fn|1}}

