Artiom Wendyl.wikitext:
{{AssassinorumPortal}}
'''Artiom Wendyl{{Fn|1}}, Codename ''Regent'',''' was an [[Eversor Assassin]] who served in [[Execution Force|Execution Force Regnum Tribunal]]{{Fn|2a}}, which was sent to kill the [[Shriven (Warband)|Shriven]] [[Chaos Lord|Sorcerer Lord]], [[Argento Corian]].{{Fn|2b}}

After the [[Vindicare]] [[Moritan Callen‎]] failed to kill [[Argento Corian|Corian]] on [[Bairsten Prime]]{{Fn|2c}}, the Execution Force had no choice but to invade the [[Shriven (Warband)|Shriven]]'s stronghold on [[Dessah]]. Luckily this occurred during the closing moments of the [[War of the Spider]], as Corian and his ally [[Fabius Bile]]'s numerous foes invaded the world as well. In the massive melee that followed, Callen attempted to kill Corian again, but was fatally burned by the [[Chaos Lord|Sorcerer Lord]]'s [[warp]]-fire. The [[Callidus]] [[Zara Nox‎]] was then able to wound Corian, before he flung her away, but in doing so he left himself open to the [[Culexus]] [[Fioros Loth]]. Drawing near to the Sorcerer Lord, the Culexus struck and robbed Corian of his [[psychic]] might. This allowed Artiom to severely wound Corian, before the Sorcerer Lord broke his neck. The [[Eversor]]'s death, however, caused his body to explode, which finally killed Corian. With their mission complete, Fioros and a wounded Zara made their escape, as the remnants of the Shriven fought to survive.{{Fn|2b}}

