Arvael.wikitext:
{{ChaosKnightsPortal}}
'''Arvael''' is a [[Chaos Knight]] of [[House Korvax]], piloting the Knight ''[[Violator (Knight)|Violator]]''.{{Fn|1}}

Originally a scion of [[House Raven]], Arvael was on [[Kolossi|his House's homeworld]] when it was stolen by [[Be'lakor]] during the [[Charadon Campaign]] and fell to [[Chaos]] with the rest of his world.{{Fn|1}}

